category: Libs
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Buffer based LRU cache (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "libvmemcache is an embeddable and lightweight in-memory caching solution. It's
designed to fully take advantage of large capacity memory, such as Persistent
Memory with DAX, through memory mapping in an efficient and scalable way."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/pmem/vmemcache
